Package: tardoc
Title: Generate Documentation and Analytics for targets Pipelines
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Cathal", "Byrne", email = "cathal.byrne@cso.ie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Auto-generates documentation for a 'targets' pipeline from
    '_targets.R' and the roxygen comments beside it: one markdown file per target
    and per function, plus a self-contained HTML viewer with an interactive
    dependency graph, fuzzy search, build status, timings, per-branch detail and
    verbatim function source. Freshness, the critical path and a diff against the
    previous build are reported alongside. Optional layers add a DuckDB WASM
    analytics page that opens from the filesystem, a local DuckDB server with
    full-text and semantic search, an LLM chat interface over the pipeline
    database via 'ellmer', and the same database as an MCP server for use with
    coding agents.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://cathalbyrnegit.github.io/tardoc/,
    https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/tardoc
BugReports: https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/tardoc/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
